    "title": "Afar Lightweight Travel Size Hair Dryer",
    "description": "The T3 Afar Lightweight Travel Size Hair Dryer is designed for both travel convenience and powerful styling. This compact dryer is 25% lighter and 30% smaller than a standard T3 dryer, making it ideal for packing. It features a stowaway folding handle and auto dual voltage for worry-free international use. The T3 IonAir Technology, with its negative ion generator, produces millions of negative ions per second to smooth the hair cuticle, reduce frizz, and enhance shine. It offers 3 heat and 2 speed settings for customized styling across all hair types, while minimizing heat exposure. Additional features include a long-life motor, a concentrator attachment, a cool shot button to lock in styles, and a 9ft. cord with a cord wrap. The dryer comes in a Satin Blush color and includes the dryer and a concentrator.",
